{
  "Scenes.Hellhound.Defeated.FlamesDimDefeated": "The hellhound's flames dim and the heads let out a whine before the creature slumps down, defeated and nearly unconscious."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.Defeated.RefusesToHurt": "Unable to bear hurting you anymore, the hellhound's flames dim as he stops his attack. The two heads look at you, whining plaintively. The hellhound slowly pads over to you and nudges its noses at your crotch. It seems he wishes to pleasure you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.BlindFireMiss": "{0}{1} completely misses you with a wave of dark fire! Thank the gods it's blind!"
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.FireFlexDodge": "Both the hellhound's heads breathe in deeply before blasting a wave of dark fire at you. You twist and drop with incredible flexibility, watching the fire blow harmlessly overhead."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.FireMisdirected": "Using Raphael's teachings and the movement afforded by your bodysuit, you anticipate and sidestep {0}{1}'s fire.\n"
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.FireWaveEvaded": "Both the hellhound's heads breathe in deeply before blasting a wave of dark fire at you. You easily avoid the wave, diving to the side and making the most of your talents at evasion."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.FireWaveHit": "Both the hellhound's heads breathe in deeply before blasting a wave of dark fire at you. While the flames don't burn much, the unnatural heat fills your body with arousal."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundFire.FlameBreathBlocked": "You reach inside yourself to breathe flames, but as you ready to release a torrent of fire, it backs up in your throat, blocked by the webbing across your mouth. It causes you to cry out as the sudden, heated force explodes in your own throat.\n"
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundScent.ScentCircling": "The hellhound sniffs your scent again, seemingly gaining more and more energy as he circles faster around you."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.HellhoundScent.ScentGround": "The hellhound keeps his four eyes on you as he sniffs the ground where you were moments ago. He raises his heads back up and gives you a fiery grin - he seems to have acquired your scent! It'll be hard to get away now..."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.Name": "hellhound"
  "Scenes.Hellhound.OutputDefaultTeaseReaction.TeaseEnjoying": "\n{0}{1} definitely seems to be enjoying the show."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.OutputDefaultTeaseReaction.TeaseGrowls": "\n{0}{1} growls softly with lust, {2} eyes filled with longing."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.OutputDefaultTeaseReaction.TeaseIntrigued": "\n{0}{1} looks intrigued by what {2} sees."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.OutputDefaultTeaseReaction.TeaseLicks": "\n{0}{1} licks {2} lips in anticipation, {3} twin cocks sticking prominently out of their sheath."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.OutputDefaultTeaseReaction.TeaseUnimpressed": "\n{0}{1} seems unimpressed."
  "Scenes.Hellhound.Won.SnortsLeaves": "[pg]The hellhound snorts and leaves you to your fate."
}
